CHAPTER.VERS:
When the LORD thy God hath cut off the nations, whose land the LORD thy God 
        giveth thee, and thou succeedest them, and dwellest in their cities, and in their houses; 

          succeedest: Heb. inheritest, or, possessest

Then both the men, between whom the controversy 
        , shall stand 
        before the LORD, before the priests and the judges, who shall be in those days;

And thy eye shall not pity; 
        life 
         for life, eye for eye, tooth for tooth, hand for hand, foot for foot.
